Package: maps
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: map viewer with place search for V\OS
 Maps is a map viewer that fetches OpenStreetMap tiles over HTTPS and
 searches places through a geocoding service, with results listed for
 instant navigation. Window layout, zooming and scrolling are plain
 V\OS interface kit controls.
